<style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>In general, congruent polygons have the same shape. In other words:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>they have the same number of sides,</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>all corresponding sides are congruent, and</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>all corresponding interior angles are congruent.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>With that in mind, let's compare the given polygons.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Statement I is true. Since the polygons <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.903ex\" height=\"2.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 819.5 1008.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\mathcal{A}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJCAL-41\" d=\"M576 668Q576 688 606 708T660 728Q676 728 675 712V571Q675 409 688 252Q696 122 720 57Q722 53 723 50T728 46T732 43T737 41T743 39L754 45Q788 61 803 61Q819 61 819 47Q818 43 814 35Q799 15 755 -7T675 -30Q659 -30 648 -25T630 -8T621 11T614 34Q603 77 599 106T594 146T591 160V163H460L329 164L316 145Q241 35 196 -7T119 -50T59 -24T30 43Q30 75 46 100T74 125Q81 125 83 120T88 104T96 84Q118 57 151 57Q189 57 277 182Q432 400 542 625L559 659H567Q574 659 575 660T576 668ZM584 249Q579 333 577 386T575 473T574 520V581L563 560Q497 426 412 290L372 228L370 224H371L383 228L393 232H586L584 249Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJCAL-41\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.543ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 664.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\\mathcal{B}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJCAL-42\" d=\"M304 342Q292 342 292 353Q292 372 323 391Q331 396 417 428T533 487Q563 512 563 555V562Q563 575 557 589T530 618T475 636Q429 636 396 613T330 539Q263 446 210 238Q196 183 173 120Q135 31 121 16Q108 1 85 -10T47 -22T32 -10Q32 -5 44 18T77 93T112 206Q135 296 154 395T182 550T191 615Q191 616 190 616Q188 616 179 611T157 601T131 594Q113 594 113 605Q113 623 144 644Q154 650 205 676T267 703Q277 705 279 705Q295 705 295 693Q295 686 288 635T278 575Q278 572 287 582Q336 635 402 669T540 704Q603 704 633 673T664 599Q664 559 638 523T580 462Q553 440 504 413L491 407L504 402Q566 381 596 338T627 244Q627 172 575 110T444 13T284 -22Q208 -22 158 28Q144 42 146 50Q150 67 178 85T230 103Q236 103 246 95T267 75T302 56T357 47Q436 47 486 93Q526 136 526 198V210Q526 228 518 249T491 292T436 330T350 345Q335 345 321 344T304 342Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJCAL-42\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> have the same number of sides and all corresponding sides and angles are congruent, we conclude that <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"7.192ex\" height=\"2.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 3096.6 1008.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\\mathcal{A}\\cong\\mathcal{B}.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJCAL-41\" d=\"M576 668Q576 688 606 708T660 728Q676 728 675 712V571Q675 409 688 252Q696 122 720 57Q722 53 723 50T728 46T732 43T737 41T743 39L754 45Q788 61 803 61Q819 61 819 47Q818 43 814 35Q799 15 755 -7T675 -30Q659 -30 648 -25T630 -8T621 11T614 34Q603 77 599 106T594 146T591 160V163H460L329 164L316 145Q241 35 196 -7T119 -50T59 -24T30 43Q30 75 46 100T74 125Q81 125 83 120T88 104T96 84Q118 57 151 57Q189 57 277 182Q432 400 542 625L559 659H567Q574 659 575 660T576 668ZM584 249Q579 333 577 386T575 473T574 520V581L563 560Q497 426 412 290L372 228L370 224H371L383 228L393 232H586L584 249Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2245\" d=\"M55 388Q55 463 101 526T222 589Q260 589 296 571T362 526T421 474T484 430T554 411Q616 411 655 458T694 560Q694 572 698 580T708 589Q722 589 722 556Q722 482 677 419T562 356H554Q517 356 481 374T414 418T355 471T292 515T223 533Q179 533 145 508Q109 479 96 440T80 378T69 355Q55 355 55 388ZM56 236Q56 249 70 256H707Q722 248 722 236Q722 225 708 217L390 216H72Q56 221 56 236ZM56 42Q56 57 72 62H708Q722 52 722 42Q722 30 707 22H70Q56 29 56 42Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJCAL-42\" d=\"M304 342Q292 342 292 353Q292 372 323 391Q331 396 417 428T533 487Q563 512 563 555V562Q563 575 557 589T530 618T475 636Q429 636 396 613T330 539Q263 446 210 238Q196 183 173 120Q135 31 121 16Q108 1 85 -10T47 -22T32 -10Q32 -5 44 18T77 93T112 206Q135 296 154 395T182 550T191 615Q191 616 190 616Q188 616 179 611T157 601T131 594Q113 594 113 605Q113 623 144 644Q154 650 205 676T267 703Q277 705 279 705Q295 705 295 693Q295 686 288 635T278 575Q278 572 287 582Q336 635 402 669T540 704Q603 704 633 673T664 599Q664 559 638 523T580 462Q553 440 504 413L491 407L504 402Q566 381 596 338T627 244Q627 172 575 110T444 13T284 -22Q208 -22 158 28Q144 42 146 50Q150 67 178 85T230 103Q236 103 246 95T267 75T302 56T357 47Q436 47 486 93Q526 136 526 198V210Q526 228 518 249T491 292T436 330T350 345Q335 345 321 344T304 342Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJCAL-41\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2245\" x=\"1097\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJCAL-42\" x=\"2153\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"2818\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Statement II is false. Notice that the polygons <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.543ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 664.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\\mathcal{B}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJCAL-42\" d=\"M304 342Q292 342 292 353Q292 372 323 391Q331 396 417 428T533 487Q563 512 563 555V562Q563 575 557 589T530 618T475 636Q429 636 396 613T330 539Q263 446 210 238Q196 183 173 120Q135 31 121 16Q108 1 85 -10T47 -22T32 -10Q32 -5 44 18T77 93T112 206Q135 296 154 395T182 550T191 615Q191 616 190 616Q188 616 179 611T157 601T131 594Q113 594 113 605Q113 623 144 644Q154 650 205 676T267 703Q277 705 279 705Q295 705 295 693Q295 686 288 635T278 575Q278 572 287 582Q336 635 402 669T540 704Q603 704 633 673T664 599Q664 559 638 523T580 462Q553 440 504 413L491 407L504 402Q566 381 596 338T627 244Q627 172 575 110T444 13T284 -22Q208 -22 158 28Q144 42 146 50Q150 67 178 85T230 103Q236 103 246 95T267 75T302 56T357 47Q436 47 486 93Q526 136 526 198V210Q526 228 518 249T491 292T436 330T350 345Q335 345 321 344T304 342Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJCAL-42\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.239ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 533.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\\mathcal{C}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJCAL-43\" d=\"M201 -25Q167 -25 136 -14T75 23T29 94T12 202Q12 290 50 394T161 574Q227 642 303 673T433 704Q435 705 457 705Q533 701 533 640Q533 606 507 548T464 474Q431 444 396 444Q381 444 381 453Q381 459 388 473T407 513T428 563Q433 580 433 594Q433 636 381 636Q314 636 260 594T175 489T128 363T112 247Q112 157 153 101T273 44Q347 44 398 121Q413 144 437 157T481 171Q496 171 496 160Q496 150 476 123Q426 56 350 16T201 -25Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJCAL-43\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> have the same number of sides, but they don't seem to have the same shape. In particular, we notice they don't have corresponding congruent angles (<span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.543ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 664.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\\mathcal{B}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJCAL-42\" d=\"M304 342Q292 342 292 353Q292 372 323 391Q331 396 417 428T533 487Q563 512 563 555V562Q563 575 557 589T530 618T475 636Q429 636 396 613T330 539Q263 446 210 238Q196 183 173 120Q135 31 121 16Q108 1 85 -10T47 -22T32 -10Q32 -5 44 18T77 93T112 206Q135 296 154 395T182 550T191 615Q191 616 190 616Q188 616 179 611T157 601T131 594Q113 594 113 605Q113 623 144 644Q154 650 205 676T267 703Q277 705 279 705Q295 705 295 693Q295 686 288 635T278 575Q278 572 287 582Q336 635 402 669T540 704Q603 704 633 673T664 599Q664 559 638 523T580 462Q553 440 504 413L491 407L504 402Q566 381 596 338T627 244Q627 172 575 110T444 13T284 -22Q208 -22 158 28Q144 42 146 50Q150 67 178 85T230 103Q236 103 246 95T267 75T302 56T357 47Q436 47 486 93Q526 136 526 198V210Q526 228 518 249T491 292T436 330T350 345Q335 345 321 344T304 342Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJCAL-42\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> does not have right angles, while <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.239ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 533.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">\\mathcal{C}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJCAL-43\" d=\"M201 -25Q167 -25 136 -14T75 23T29 94T12 202Q12 290 50 394T161 574Q227 642 303 673T433 704Q435 705 457 705Q533 701 533 640Q533 606 507 548T464 474Q431 444 396 444Q381 444 381 453Q381 459 388 473T407 513T428 563Q433 580 433 594Q433 636 381 636Q314 636 260 594T175 489T128 363T112 247Q112 157 153 101T273 44Q347 44 398 121Q413 144 437 157T481 171Q496 171 496 160Q496 150 476 123Q426 56 350 16T201 -25Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJCAL-43\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> does).</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Statement III is false. By the same reasoning as above, we can see that the polygons <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.239ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 533.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\\mathcal{C}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJCAL-43\" d=\"M201 -25Q167 -25 136 -14T75 23T29 94T12 202Q12 290 50 394T161 574Q227 642 303 673T433 704Q435 705 457 705Q533 701 533 640Q533 606 507 548T464 474Q431 444 396 444Q381 444 381 453Q381 459 388 473T407 513T428 563Q433 580 433 594Q433 636 381 636Q314 636 260 594T175 489T128 363T112 247Q112 157 153 101T273 44Q347 44 398 121Q413 144 437 157T481 171Q496 171 496 160Q496 150 476 123Q426 56 350 16T201 -25Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJCAL-43\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.903ex\" height=\"2.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 819.5 1008.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\\mathcal{A}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJCAL-41\" d=\"M576 668Q576 688 606 708T660 728Q676 728 675 712V571Q675 409 688 252Q696 122 720 57Q722 53 723 50T728 46T732 43T737 41T743 39L754 45Q788 61 803 61Q819 61 819 47Q818 43 814 35Q799 15 755 -7T675 -30Q659 -30 648 -25T630 -8T621 11T614 34Q603 77 599 106T594 146T591 160V163H460L329 164L316 145Q241 35 196 -7T119 -50T59 -24T30 43Q30 75 46 100T74 125Q81 125 83 120T88 104T96 84Q118 57 151 57Q189 57 277 182Q432 400 542 625L559 659H567Q574 659 575 660T576 668ZM584 249Q579 333 577 386T575 473T574 520V581L563 560Q497 426 412 290L372 228L370 224H371L383 228L393 232H586L584 249Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJCAL-41\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> are not congruent.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"</p>\n\n                    </div>     \n                </div>                            \n                    \n            </div>",
